# id|AudioWRT package|title|description
mpd|audiowrt-mpd|Local Music|Play local files and HTTP streams with MPD through the selected ALSA output.
airplay|audiowrt-airplay|AirPlay|Receive AirPlay audio through Shairport Sync and the selected ALSA output.
spotify|audiowrt-spotify|Spotify Connect|Expose this OpenWrt device as a Spotify Connect speaker through librespot. Spotify Premium is required by librespot.
